---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="你访问的页面不存在或已被移动。">
  <section class="container-page flex flex-col items-center py-28 text-center">
    <p class="font-mono text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-300 sm:text-7xl">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white">这一页被雕刻工具删掉了</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-md leading-7 text-zinc-400">页面不存在或已被移动。回到首页，或从文档中心继续浏览。</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="btn-primary px-6 py-2.5 text-sm">
        返回首页
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/" class="btn-secondary px-6 py-2.5 text-sm">
        <Icon name="book" size={16} />
        文档中心
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
